    "title": "UPDATED: Expect Jungermann Road Lane Closure for Storm Grate Repairs - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago The northbound outer lane of Jungermann Road near 955 Jungermann Rd., south of Willott Road and in front of St. Peters Town Centre, is scheduled to be closed Monday, March 9, 2026, beginning at 8 a.m., to allow City crews to repair a storm grate. The lane is expected to reopen the morning of Monday, March 16. The project will remove and replace the concrete slab surrounding the grate. All work is weather permitting. The project was originally scheduled to begin today, March 4, but was delayed due to rain. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
